## `fundere`: los métodos del embed se promueven. `e.move(...)` se emite como
## `GameObj_move(&e.gameObj, ...)`, también dentro de `with:`. El método propio
## gana si el host declara el mismo nombre, y la promoción es recursiva.
import std.spark

rune Base:
    depth as int

enchanting Base:
    weave deep into int:
        return self->depth

rune Mid fundere Base:
    level as int

enchanting Mid:
    weave through into int:
        return calling self.deep + self->level

rune Top fundere Mid:
    top as int

enchanting Top:
    weave bump with n as int into void:
        set self->top is self->top + n
    weave through into int:
        return self->top + 99

weave main into int:
    var t as Top is with mid is (with base is (with depth is 5), level is 2), top is 1
    calling t.bump with 4
    with t:
        calling .bump with 1
    calling spark.println with "{t.top},{calling t.through},{calling t.deep}"
    return 0
